 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 9 of B005 (packets 205-581). 28 standard searches, snippets/summaries only. New pins (passiondlp Q4 2019): CM Exclusive 'Tic & Tac Noël' 3019 (28/11/19); 'Raiponce Noël' LE 700 15.99 Disney Art Gallery 6 Dec (Disneyphile corroborates date/price, co-creation); 'Winnie l'Ourson Noël' Christmas Jumper Day LE 700 15.99 Disney Art Gallery. Release evidence: Fabius medallion = 'Polochon' (Flounder) per passiondlp Q3. Corroboration: medallion trio 150 each, Carrousel Snow White Aug 700 15.99 Pueblo, 14 Juillet LE 700 Pueblo (hold kept, design unknown), Rapunzel 12 Oct LE 700. Still open: Christmas Time 9 Nov designs, Phantom Manor doom buggies, 5 Jan LE designs, PTN sizes, Marvel price, dein-dlrp Jan/May/Oct unindexed, 13 Jul Pin Trading Day designs."
